// apklayer's own code for the AOSP tree. Layout (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md "Android side and host side"):
//   hals/<domain>/...   HAL services and libraries (AIDL frontends), one directory per HAL domain
//   tools/              development tools run with bridge/native/btload.c --main
// This directory is synced to vendor/apklayer (tools/sync-aosp.sh) and built with `m <module>`, as recorded in
// docs/AOSP-BUILDS.md. Executables are built as shared libraries exporting main(): bionic_translation loads libraries.
package {
    default_visibility: ["//visibility:public"],
}
